🌐 Task-3 – Interactive Web App
CodSoft Web Development Internship | Level 1

📋 Project Overview
Task-3 is an interactive web application built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript as part of the CodSoft Level 1 Internship.
It focuses on creating a dynamic and user-friendly interface, allowing users to perform actions in real-time.

🛠️ Technologies Used
💻 HTML5
🎨 CSS3
⚡ JavaScript

✨ Features
✅ Interactive buttons and UI
✅ Real-time user interactions
📱 Responsive and clean design
🏗️ Beginner-friendly structure for learning


